  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "ChalkQL 0.3 adds composite types, native CLR types for functions and aggregates,\n      borrowed UTF-8/BINARY spans, population-safe aggregates, repeated-expression reuse,\n      and corrected DECIMAL/floating-point semantics.\n\n      Breaking changes include the borrowed-text API, PrepareOptions becoming a record,\n      explicit source row-level-security preconditions, and result changes for DECIMAL\n      rescaling and floating-point rounding.\n\n      Full release notes:\n      https://github.com/markhammond/chalkql/releases/tag/v0.3",
